+## 3b. UI design (Lark-inspired)
+
+The interface follows the visual language of the Lark Player package — dark-green
+theme, 56dp header with logo + actions, pill tabs, 80dp song rows with rounded
+covers, rounded mini-player card and a large-cover "now playing" screen.
+Palette and proportions were taken as a reference only; every layout, drawable and
+icon in this repo is original (no Lark logo, bitmap, string or code was copied).
+
+| Screen | What changed |
+|---|---|
+| Main | Header (logo, title, search, about), pill tabs **Songs / Favorites**, 80dp rows (64dp rounded cover, bold title, caption, duration, equalizer overlay + green title on the playing row), search pill that replaces the header |
+| Mini player | Rounded card with cover, title/artist, previous / play (green circle) / next |
+| Now playing | Chevron-down header, large rounded cover, title + artist + favorite, seek bar with times, shuffle / previous / play / next / repeat (off → all → one) |
+| About | Same dark-green style, back arrow, info card |
+
+Theme and palette live in `res/values/colors.xml` and `res/values/themes.xml`.
+
+---
+
 ## 4. Build
 
 ### Option A — Android Studio (easiest)
